From 562de985cbb7a721683eb932d087ed163b254ee2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sento Daimon <339524263+sentodaimon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:09:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Coin Series stage 1: five coin chain parameters, reward
 schedule, per-chain money limit

- -coin=half|quarter|dime|nickel|cent combined with -chain=main|test|regtest
- per coin/environment: network magic, ports, data directory, address prefixes,
  merge slot, signature chain id, development placeholder genesis
- block reward: new-chain height h rewarded as Bitcoin height 840000+h, times multiplier
- money limit: 21 million x multiplier per chain (Bitcoin unchanged)
- unit tests (coinseries_tests) and five-coin regtest smoke test
